  m_text: "4. Conclusion of Game \t\t\t\t\t\t\tFormal Definition of TuringMachine\n   
    End of Goal\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tN = (Q, \u03A3, \u0393, \u03B4, q0, q_accept, q_reject)\n   
    Your machine will eventually:\t\t\t\t\t          Q set of states (q0, ..., q4)
    \n    Accept the input (halt in an accept state), or\t\t\u03A3 input alphabet
    (for this TM, {0, 1})\n    Reject the input (halt in a reject state), or\t\t\t\u0393
    is the tape alphabet (includes \u03A3 & blank _)\n    Loop forever if no halting
    state is reached\t\t\u03B4 transition function & q0 is the start state"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
