  m_text: "2. Explore the State Diagram\n    After you enter your input, you\u2019ll
    see the machine\u2019s states (q0, q1, q2, q3, q4) and the direction connecting
    them. \n    Each direction shows what the machine reads, what it writes back,
    which way the head moves, and which state it \n    goes to next.\n    "
